#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:1
msgid "Caohejing Development Zone"
msgstr "漕河泾开发区"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:4
msgid "漕河泾开发区"
msgstr "漕河泾开发区"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Xuhui | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜徐汇区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:8
msgid "AI and industry focus: Software AI, Hardware AI, Industry."
msgstr "AI及产业方向：AI软件、AI硬件、产业。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:10
msgid ""
"The park operator publishes enterprise and intellectual-property service "
"routes. Confirm the specific sub-park and operating address; the "
"Caohejing name covers multiple development locations."
msgstr "运营方公布了企业服务及知识产权服务渠道。漕河泾涉及多个开发区域，需明确具体子园区及实际经营地址。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S049 <https://chj.shlingang.com/chj/yqfw/sclb/yszx/>`_. 漕河泾开发区."
msgstr "`资料来源 S049 <https://chj.shlingang.com/chj/yqfw/sclb/yszx/>`_. 漕河泾开发区."

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:24
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://chj.shlingang.com/>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://chj.shlingang.com/>`_"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:26
msgid "Telephone: +86 21 64850000."
msgstr "电话：+86 21 64850000。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:28
msgid "Published address: 1015 Caobao Road, Shanghai."
msgstr "公开地址：上海市漕宝路1015号。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:37
msgid "Send a project brief and request the current admission checklist."
msgstr "发送项目简介，索取最新入驻条件及材料清单。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:39
msgid ""
"Complete the operator's eligibility and technical or commercial review."
msgstr "按运营机构要求完成资格审核及技术或商业评审。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:41
msgid ""
"Confirm rent, service fees, IP, compute pricing and any equity rights in "
"writing."
msgstr "书面确认租金、服务费、知识产权、算力价格及股权相关条款。"

#: ../../entities/caohejing.rst:43
msgid ""
"Sign the agreed admission documents and record milestones and support "
"owners."
msgstr "签署入驻协议，明确阶段目标和服务对接人。"

